  "reason": "Existing evidence shows scvi_n200 encoder (config_005/006) outperforms PCA_n2000 in multiprofile setups, but scgpt encoder performance remains untested. This experiment tests scgpt in a multiprofile setup with transformer aggregation (a method shown to slightly improve performance over avgpool in config_006). It directly compares a novel encoder (scgpt) against the current RNA encoder baseline (scvi_n200), isolating the impact of encoder choice while maintaining consistent aggregation and profile settings. This addresses uncertainty about whether encoder architecture is a critical factor, using a configuration that builds on prior multiprofile success without introducing unnecessary complexity."
}

